Octans Player Runtime licensing

This repository is a build recipe. Different files use different licenses.

1. Octans-authored build files

Copyright (c) 2026 Octans Media

These paths are under the MIT License. The license text is LICENSES/MIT.txt:

- scripts/, except scripts/overlays/media3-ffmpeg-decoder/
- Dockerfile*
- .gitea/workflows/
- build-manifests/
- README.md, AGENTS.md, and the other metadata files at the repository root

2. Media3 FFmpeg decoder overlay

scripts/overlays/media3-ffmpeg-decoder/ is under the Apache License, Version 2.0,
as stated in the file headers. The license text is LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.

3. Components downloaded at build time

The components recorded in build-manifests/ are not part of this repository.
This file does not change their licenses. Built artifacts must ship their
licenses/ and sources/ trees with the binaries.
